{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/wraith-the-oblivion/909945-if-risen-abandon-their-bodies-can-they-use-the-2-risen-arcanoi-in-the-tempest","id":909945,"title":"if risen abandon their bodies can they use the 2 risen arcanoi in the tempest?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Wraith: The Oblivion"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-06-08T03:08:01-07:00","id":909945,"title":"if risen abandon their bodies can they use the 2 risen arcanoi in the tempest?","content":"also do the 4 vampiric disciplines they can learn(fortitude obfuscate celerity potence) stay with them in their wraithly form?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1492-mark","name":"mark","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1492_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1379"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-08T03:37:28-07:00","id":909957,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"font-family:courier new\">The two Arcanoi? As the ST, if you want them to, sure. However, I think the <i>intention</i> of Fascinate and Serendipity is Risen-only. Characters don\u2019t lose knowledge of them if they un-Rise, but they can\u2019t use them unless the get back in their bodies.<br /> <br /> Same thing with Disciplines. Those are part of the walking-corpse-club; characters don\u2019t unlearn them, but they don\u2019t apply to ectoplasmic bodies.</span>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:8px\"><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms\">&lt;signature&gt; something witty &lt;/signature&gt;</span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/302-nazfool","name":"Nazfool","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar302_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"753"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-09T00:43:31-07:00","id":910611,"title":"","content":"I would say no, as the book describes them as &quot;Risen-specific,&quot; but there's not really anything they do that would break a game if used in the Underworld, so...<br /> <br /> Go for it, if you like. Like <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/302-nazfool\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar302_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"302\" data-vbnamecard=\"302\">Nazfool</a> said, it's not like the knowledge is wiped out of the character's minds when they cross back over.<br /> <br /> Cheers!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>If you don't use an Oxford comma, I feel bad for you, son,<br /> 'Cuz I got ninety-nine problems, but clarity ain't one.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/408-nothing","name":"nothing","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar408_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"572"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-09T03:19:09-07:00","id":910663,"title":"","content":"I'd say no to all. They're effects that work on dead bodies or the mortals who witness them. They wouldn't work in the Underworld.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer, publisher, performer<br /> Mostly he/his, sometimes she/her IRL <a href=\"https://adam-lowe.com\" target=\"_blank\">https://adam-lowe.com</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5291-adambeyoncelowe","name":"adambeyoncelowe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5291_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2802"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-09T09:17:48-07:00","id":910862,"title":"","content":"one last thing. is it possible for wraiths to learn hedge magic? my gut instict says no but i can't remember anything prohibiting it","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1492-mark","name":"mark","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1492_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1379"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-09T16:30:35-07:00","id":911233,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>mark</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/wraith-the-oblivion/909945-if-risen-abandon-their-bodies-can-they-use-the-2-risen-arcanoi-in-the-tempest?p=910862#post910862\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">one last thing. is it possible for wraiths to learn hedge magic? my gut instict says no but i can't remember anything prohibiting it</div> </div> </div> </div><span style=\"font-family:courier new\">AFAIK, that is a negative. I did, however, toy around with the idea of Risen being able to learn some Necromancy. The Bone Path feeling particularly appropriate for a Risen. I never tested because 1) None of my players wanted to Rise and 2) I was inspired by <i>Hollowfaust</i> and had some concerns that I was inappropriately crossing some very different themes. Anyhoo, no magic for Wraiths. </span>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:8px\"><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms\">&lt;signature&gt; something witty &lt;/signature&gt;</span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/302-nazfool","name":"Nazfool","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar302_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"753"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}